# Prose is hand-formatted; Prettier is for code only.
#
# `npm run format`'s globs already exclude markdown, but that only governs the
# CLI. An editor's format-on-save or an ad-hoc `prettier --write <path>` bypasses
# them, and a pass like that rewrites markdown emphasis and inline code spans:
# it turned `_false_` into `\_false*` and glued prose into code spans across
# three findings of an architecture report on 2026-08-20 (agentic-review I3).
# This file is the enforcement the globs cannot provide.
#
# See CLAUDE.md §Documentation Discipline.
*.md
